---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import LessonCard from '../../components/LessonCard.astro';
import { LESSONS } from '../../data/site';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="概念图解"
  description="十二个可交互的 LLM 概念实验：张量形状、Softmax、注意力、反向传播、RoPE、采样、训练循环、KV Cache、因果掩码、归一化、SwiGLU 与 MoE。每个实验都对应 mini-llm 中已经跑通的 Rust 代码。"
>
  <section class="learn-hero">
    <div class="shell">
      <p class="eyebrow">概念图解</p>
      <h1>十二个实验，建立 LLM 的直觉骨架</h1>
      <p class="learn-hero__lead">
        大模型的公式不算多，难的是把符号和真实的数据流动对应起来。这十二个页面用最小的例子、可拖动的参数，把
        <strong>形状 → 概率 → 注意力 → 梯度 → 位置 → 采样 → 训练 → 缓存 → 掩码 → 归一化 → 门控 → 专家</strong>
        这条链条走一遍。公式旁边就是仓库里对应的实现。
      </p>
      <div class="learn-hero__hint">
        <span class="mono">建议顺序</span>
        <span>01 张量</span><span class="sep" aria-hidden="true">→</span>
        <span>02 Softmax</span><span class="sep" aria-hidden="true">→</span>
        <span>03 注意力</span><span class="sep" aria-hidden="true">→</span>
        <span>04 梯度</span><span class="sep" aria-hidden="true">→</span>
        <span>05 位置</span><span class="sep" aria-hidden="true">→</span>
        <span>06 采样</span><span class="sep" aria-hidden="true">→</span>
        <span>07 训练</span><span class="sep" aria-hidden="true">→</span>
        <span>08 缓存</span><span class="sep" aria-hidden="true">→</span>
        <span>09 掩码</span><span class="sep" aria-hidden="true">→</span>
        <span>10 归一化</span><span class="sep" aria-hidden="true">→</span>
        <span>11 门控</span><span class="sep" aria-hidden="true">→</span>
        <span>12 MoE</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <div class="shell">
    <div class="grid grid--3 learn-grid">
      {LESSONS.map((lesson) => <LessonCard lesson={lesson} />)}
    </div>

    <div class="learn-foot">
      <div class="note">
        <strong>读完图解之后</strong>
        想补数学推导，去读<a class="link-underline" href="/docs/math-foundations">《数学基础与神经网络原理》</a>；
        想知道这些形状为什么这么定，去读<a class="link-underline" href="/docs/tensor-engine">《Tensor Engine 深度解析》</a>。
        两篇都来自仓库的 <code>docs/</code>。
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .learn-hero {
    padding: 68px 0 48px;
  }

  .learn-hero h1 {
    margin: 16px 0 0;
    font-size: clamp(2.2rem, 4.4vw, 3.2rem);
    line-height: 1.08;
    letter-spacing: -0.035em;
    font-weight: 640;
    max-width: 18em;
    text-wrap: balance;
  }

  .learn-hero__lead {
    margin: 22px 0 0;
    max-width: 58ch;
    font-size: 16.5px;
    line-height: 1.8;
    color: var(--ink-soft);
  }

  .learn-hero__lead strong {
    color: var(--ink);
    font-weight: 600;
    word-break: keep-all;
  }

  .learn-hero__hint {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8px 10px;
    margin-top: 26px;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 11px;
    color: var(--ink-faint);
  }

  .learn-hero__hint .mono {
    padding: 3px 7px;
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius: 4px;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    font-size: 9.5px;
  }

  .learn-grid {
    margin-top: 8px;
  }

  .learn-foot {
    max-width: 720px;
    margin: 40px 0 88px;
  }
</style>
